        [
          "We came here to listen, not to win.\nWe reflected, we learned, and where necessary we restored, strengthened, adjusted, or renewed.\nThe record is not the person.\nThe review is not the punishment.\nThe goal is not perfection.\nThe goal is a stronger Steward, a stronger system, a stronger relationship, and a stronger Legacy.\nWe leave this reflection with greater understanding than we entered it.\nThe work continues because the Legacy is still becoming.",
